ent line is shifted left by one for each digit. So the hundreds place would be shifted two places (since hundreds are two digits away from the ones). Let me make sure I'm doing this right.\n\nAlternatively, maybe breaking it down as 201 = 200 + 1, so 455 × 200 + 455 × 1. That might be simpler. Let's see:.\n\n455 × 200 = 455 × 2 × 100 = 910 × 100 = 91,000. .\n\nThen 455 × 1 = 455. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
