ace digit (100):**\n   \\[\n   239 \\times 100 = 23900\n   \\]\n\n4. **Sum all the results:**\n   \\[\n   1434 + 16730 + 23900\n   \\]\n   - First, add \\(1434\\) and \\(16730\\):\n     \\[\n     1434 + 16730 = 18164\n     \\]\n   - Then add the result to \\(23900\\):\n     \\[\n     18164 + 23900 = 42064\n     \\]\n\nThus, the product of 239 and 176 is \\(\\boxed{42064}\\).",
