sum is 13, so we need to carry over. So the ten thousands place becomes 3, and carry over 1 to the hundred thousands place. .\n\nTherefore:.\n\nHundred thousands: 2 +1 (carry) =3.\n\nTen thousands: 3 (from 13).\n\nThousands:7.\n\nHundreds:8.\n\nTens:9.\n\nOnes:6. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
