83,900.\n\nNow I have to add all three partial products together: 1,678 + 25,170 + 83,900. Let's add them step by step. First, add 1,678 and 25,170. 1,678 + 25,170.. 1,600 + 25,000 is 26,600, and 78 + 170 is 248. So adding those gives 26,600 + 248 = 26,848. Then add the last partial product: 26,848 + 83,900. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
