iply 442 by the tens place digit (0) of 203:**\n   \\[\n   442 \\times 0 = 0 \\quad (\\text{shifted one position to the left, resulting in } 0)\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 442 by the hundreds place digit (2) of 203:**\n   \\[\n   442 \\times 2 = 884 \\quad (\\text{shifted two positions to the left, resulting in } 88400)\n   \\]\n\nSumming all the partial products:\n\\[\n1326 + 0 + 88400 = 89726\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product is \\boxed{89726}.'] 33%|###2      | 163/500 [4:21:55<7:07:09, 76.05s/it]
