he hundreds). Let me write them down:.\n\n692  .\n+13,840  .\n+69,200  .\n________.\n\nStarting with the first two: 692 + 13,840. Let's add those. 692 + 13,840. 13,840 plus 600 is 14,440, then plus 92 is 14,532. Wait, let me check again: 13,840 + 692. 13,840 + 600 is 14,440, then add 92: 14,440 + 90 = 14,530, plus 2 is 14,532. Okay, that's right.\n\nNow add that to 69,200. So 14,532 + 69,200. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
