 and then shift two places to the left because it's the hundreds place. Let me compute 832 × 6 first. .\n\nBreaking down 832 × 6: .\n\n800 × 6 = 4800,.\n30 × 6 = 180,.\n2 × 6 = 12.\n\nAdding those together: 4800 + 180 = 4980; 4980 +12 = 4992. .\n\nSo that gives 4992. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
