First, 2,598 + 8,660. Let's see, 2,500 + 8,600 is 11,100. Then 98 + 60 is 158. So total is 11,100 + 158 = 11,258. .\n\nNow add that to 303,100. 303,100 + 11,258. Hmm, 300,000 + 11,000 is 311,000. Then 3,100 + 258 is 3,358. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
