   \\]\n\nNext, we sum all the partial products:\n\\[\n5106 + 8510 + 680800\n\\]\n\nFirst, add the first two results:\n\\[\n5106 + 8510 = 13616\n\\]\n\nThen add this result to the third partial product:\n\\[\n13616 + 680800 = 694416\n\\]\n\nThus, the final computed product is \\(\\boxed{694416}\\).",
