ace), and 321,600 (from the hundreds place). Let me add them step by step. .\n\nFirst, 1206 + 16,080. Let's see, 1206 + 16,000 is 17,206, then add 80 more to get 17,286. Then add that to 321,600. .\n\nAdding 17,286 and 321,600. Hmm, 321,600 + 17,000 is 338,600. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
