0 to get 328,500. That's the third part.\n\nNow I need to add all three results together: 2920 + 14,600 + 328,500. Let me add the first two first. 2920 +14,600 = 17,520. Then add that to 328,500. 17,520 + 328,500. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
