orrect.\n\nNow I need to add up all the parts from each step. The first step was 3,275, the second step was 0, and the third step is 196,500. Adding those together: 3,275 + 0 is 3,275. Then 3,275 + 196,500. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
